sequenceDiagram
    participant CLOUD as Central Vault
    participant AWX as AWX
    participant BRIDGE as KV-bridge
    participant ANTENNA_VAULT as Antenna-Vault
    participant ANTENNA_DOCKER as Antenna-docker

    Note over CLOUD,ANTENNA_DOCKER: Bootstrap
    CLOUD->>AWX: bootstrap token
    AWX->>BRIDGE: relay bootstrap token
    AWX->>ANTENNA_VAULT: relay bootstrap token
    AWX->>ANTENNA_DOCKER: relay bootstrap token

    BRIDGE->>CLOUD: get new token + antenna address
    CLOUD-->>BRIDGE: token + antenna address

    BRIDGE->>ANTENNA_VAULT: push new secret
    BRIDGE->>ANTENNA_VAULT: get token
    ANTENNA_VAULT-->>BRIDGE: token

    ANTENNA_DOCKER->>ANTENNA_VAULT: get token
    ANTENNA_VAULT-->>ANTENNA_DOCKER: token

    BRIDGE->>ANTENNA_VAULT: read secret
    ANTENNA_VAULT-->>BRIDGE: secret

    ANTENNA_DOCKER->>ANTENNA_VAULT: read secret
    ANTENNA_VAULT-->>ANTENNA_DOCKER: secret

    Note over CLOUD,ANTENNA_DOCKER: Passed
    BRIDGE ->> CLOUD: Get secrets
    BRIDGE ->> ANTENNA_VAULT: Push Secrets
    BRIDGE ->> ANTENNA_VAULT: Get Secrets